sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant K as Keypad
  participant R as reducer
  participant H as useCalculator
  participant A as API client
  box rgb(220, 252, 231) Go service
    participant M as middleware
    participant HD as handler
    participant S as service
    participant D as domain
  end

  K->>R: keys 2, Add, 3, Equals
  R-->>H: pending add with 2 and 3
  H->>A: calculate add [2, 3]
  Note over H,A: keys are ignored while the request is in flight
  A->>M: POST /api/v1/calculations<br/>{"operation":"add","operands":[2,3]}
  Note over M: RequestID, Recover, SecurityHeaders,<br/>Logging, CORS, RateLimit, BodyLimit
  M->>HD: request with an id, inside the limits
  HD->>HD: check media type, decode, validate shape
  HD->>S: Calculate add [2, 3]

  alt 2 + 3 works
    S->>D: Add 2 and 3
    D-->>S: 5
    S->>S: round to 15 significant digits
    S-->>HD: 5
    HD-->>A: 200 application/json<br/>{"operation":"add","operands":[2,3],"result":5}
    A-->>H: result 5
    H->>R: dispatch result 5
    R-->>K: display shows 5
    H->>H: write "2 + 3 = 5" to history in localStorage
  else 1 ÷ 0 is refused
    S->>D: Divide 1 by 0
    D-->>S: DivisionByZero error
    S-->>HD: domain error
    HD-->>A: 422 application/problem+json<br/>code DIVISION_BY_ZERO
    A-->>H: problem with its detail text
    H->>R: dispatch failure
    R-->>K: display shows Error, ErrorBanner shows the detail
  end
